{"3347690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Among the Waves", "steam_appid": 3347690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CARRY THE DIVINE CHILD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry the divine Child. Bend the laws of physics, uncover the mystery of the Doors of Birth, and decide the fate of a world where artificial intelligence has learned to believe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347690/extras/2947d0d519cddd88bb384eeca47472cf.avif?t=1783451987\" width=1000 height=564 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BEND THE LAWS OF PHYSICS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Child grants you control over the laws of physics. Manipulate gravity, alter your own mass, unleash shockwaves, and reshape the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347690/extras/842c7c78825c10dded4aa987a2e1f3bb.poster.avif?t=1783451987\" width=1000 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347690/extras/842c7c78825c10dded4aa987a2e1f3bb.webm?t=1783451987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347690/extras/842c7c78825c10dded4aa987a2e1f3bb.mp4?t=1783451987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE ALATYR-M</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose yourself in a colossal black matryoshka fortress where every corridor hides another secret. The deeper you descend, the stranger the world becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some mysteries have survived for centuries. Others are only beginning to awaken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347690/extras/77345f206867afa0fae203dfdd47f694.avif?t=1783451987\" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FACE THE UNKNOWN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two bosses play alike. Adapt, experiment, and overcome encounters built around unique mechanics—not repetition. Every victory must be earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347690/extras/82bc6ef9bb4177862680b876589cdb88.poster.avif?t=1783451987\" width=1000 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347690/extras/82bc6ef9bb4177862680b876589cdb88.webm?t=1783451987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347690/extras/82bc6ef9bb4177862680b876589cdb88.mp4?t=1783451987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR OWN PATH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is rarely only one solution. Hidden routes, alternative approaches, and physics-based gameplay reward curiosity and experimentation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347690/extras/5cb9604224afdc7edceb0001a2c0c657.poster.avif?t=1783451987\" width=1000 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347690/extras/5cb9604224afdc7edceb0001a2c0c657.webm?t=1783451987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347690/extras/5cb9604224afdc7edceb0001a2c0c657.mp4?t=1783451987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WELCOME TO ORTHODOXPUNK</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A future where faith was never left behind. Ancient rituals power advanced machines. Prayers intertwine with code.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347690/extras/544cb015bd45bb644756b9d74f8b5e32.poster.avif?t=1783451987\" width=1000 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347690/extras/544cb015bd45bb644756b9d74f8b5e32.webm?t=1783451987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347690/extras/544cb015bd45bb644756b9d74f8b5e32.mp4?t=1783451987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Child awaits. Add Among the Waves to your wishlist.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347690/extras/21463f92a4f9a9b2410ed43cb6094e74.poster.avif?t=1783451987\" width=1170 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347690/extras/21463f92a4f9a9b2410ed43cb6094e74.webm?t=1783451987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347690/extras/21463f92a4f9a9b2410ed43cb6094e74.mp4?t=1783451987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CARRY THE DIVINE CHILD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry the divine Child. Bend 